<% title = "Your Fitness Progress"; %>
<% content = `
<h2>Track Your Fitness Progress</h2>
<p>Welcome to your progress tracker! This page is designed to help you monitor your growth and achievements in both gym workouts and soccer skills.</p> <p>To stay on top of your progress, you can record your workouts and soccer practice either on your phone or with a simple notebook.</p> <p>If you prefer paper, a workout journal or progress chart can be a great tool. Simply jot down the exercises, number of sets, and weights or drills you've completed. Review your entries regularly to see patterns and identify areas where you need to push yourself harder.</p> <p>Tracking your progress is essential for continuous improvement. Whether digital or paper, the key is consistency. By recording your achievements, you'll stay motivated to push beyond your limits and achieve even greater results with each session.</p>
<p>Record your stats, set new goals, and watch yourself improve every day.</p>
<img src="/images/progress-tracker.jpg" alt="Progress Tracker" style="width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:10px; margin-top:20px;">
` %>
